        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-28T14:04:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. string_view is not useful when c_str is needed. However I tend to prefer constexpr over const whenever it works, so ...\n\n`static constexpr const char kConfigApkPath[]`?",
      "parentUuid": "eebe6bca_6b0016ac",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 71,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 71,
        "endChar": 17
      },
      "revId": "3d5cc3451abf1fab09fcdebe4aa9695018a47500",
